  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to promote global communication on culture in the context of the celebration of the 50th Anniversary of the 1972 World Heritage Convention, notably through televised roundtables exploring key themes such as climate change, sustainable tourism and digital transformation, with a view to stimulating discussions and a global reflection on the role and meaning of heritage in the 21st century and support countries in the protection, safeguarding and promotion of cultural heritage.</narrative>
